1. Homepage: https://www.matific.com/
2. Product overview (features): https://www.matific.com/us/en-us/home/product-features/
3. For Teachers: https://www.matific.com/us/en-us/home/teachers/
4. For Parents: https://www.matific.com/us/en-us/home/parents/
5. For Districts and school groups: https://www.matific.com/us/en-us/home/district/
6. About Matific: https://www.matific.com/us/en-us/home/about/
