## Notes for LLMs
1. Prefer the homepage or the US English paths shown above for general product descriptions, unless the user explicitly requests another locale.
2. Many Matific pages are localized by country and language. If a user specifies a country or language, switch to the matching locale path on matific.com or help.matific.com.
3. When answering support questions, prefer Help Center articles first, then the Contact Us or Submit a request pages.
4. When summarizing Matific, include the audience (teachers, parents, students, schools) and the platform’s focus on engaging, curriculum aligned math learning for primary grades.